msgid "Percentages"
msgstr "Asilimia"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Proportion"
msgstr "Sawia"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "You are here"
msgstr "Uko hapa"

# How we are different
#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Not your usual e-learning"
msgstr "Si masomo ya mtandaoni ya kawaida"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid ""
"Most e-learning sites give everyone the same notes and one quiz. EduKenya "
"works differently."
msgstr ""
"Tovuti nyingi za masomo huwapa wote maelezo yale yale na jaribio moja. "
"EduKenya ni tofauti."

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Usual e-learning"
msgstr "Masomo ya kawaida ya mtandaoni"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "With EduKenya"
msgstr "Ukiwa na EduKenya"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Same notes for every learner"
msgstr "Maelezo yale yale kwa kila mwanafunzi"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "One quiz, then move on"
msgstr "Jaribio moja, kisha unaendelea"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Topics feel disconnected"
msgstr "Mada hazihusiani"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Answers from anywhere online"
msgstr "Majibu kutoka popote mtandaoni"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Lessons rewritten to suit how you learn"
msgstr "Masomo huandikwa upya kulingana na jinsi unavyojifunza"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Practise until you truly get it"
msgstr "Fanya mazoezi hadi uelewe kweli"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Every topic links to what comes next"
msgstr "Kila mada inaunganishwa na inayofuata"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Answers only from CBC materials"
msgstr "Majibu kutoka kwa nyenzo za CBC pekee"

# Features
#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "What makes EduKenya special"
msgstr "Kinachoifanya EduKenya kuwa ya kipekee"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Built on CBC"
msgstr "Imejengwa juu ya CBC"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid ""
"Our AI reads only from approved CBC materials, so every answer matches what "
"you learn in class."
msgstr ""
"Akili bandia yetu husoma nyenzo za CBC zilizoidhinishwa pekee, hivyo kila "
"jibu linalingana na unachojifunza darasani."

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Explained your way"
msgstr "Imeelezwa kwa njia yako"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid ""
"Stuck? Ask for a new explanation. EduKenya rewrites the lesson with simpler "
"words, examples or pictures."
msgstr ""
"Umekwama? Omba maelezo mapya. EduKenya huandika somo upya kwa maneno rahisi, "
"mifano au picha."

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Master it, then move on"
msgstr "Elewa kwanza, kisha endelea"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid ""
"Each topic has a few short tests. Get them right and the next topic unlocks."
msgstr ""
"Kila mada ina majaribio mafupi machache. Ukiyapita, mada inayofuata "
"inafunguka."

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Everything connects"
msgstr "Kila kitu kinaungana"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid ""
"Topics are linked like a map, so what you learn in Grade 7 leads smoothly "
"into Grade 8."
msgstr ""
"Mada zimeunganishwa kama ramani, hivyo unachojifunza Gredi 7 kinakuongoza "
"vizuri hadi Gredi 8."

# How it works
#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "How learning works"
msgstr "Jinsi kujifunza kunavyofanya kazi"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Learn"
msgstr "Jifunze"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Read a short lesson made for you."
msgstr "Soma somo fupi lililoandaliwa kwa ajili yako."

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Practise"
msgstr "Fanya mazoezi"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Try a few quick questions."
msgstr "Jaribu maswali machache ya haraka."

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Get help"
msgstr "Pata msaada"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Not quite? Get a fresh explanation and try again."
msgstr "Bado hujaelewa? Pata maelezo mapya na ujaribu tena."

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Level up"
msgstr "Panda ngazi"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Pass and unlock the next topic."
msgstr "Pita na ufungue mada inayofuata."

# For schools
#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "One place for the whole school"
msgstr "Mahali pamoja kwa shule nzima"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid ""
"EduKenya also does the everyday school jobs, so you do not need another "
"system."
msgstr ""
"EduKenya pia hushughulikia kazi za kila siku za shule, hivyo huhitaji mfumo "
"mwingine."

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Students"
msgstr "Wanafunzi"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Lessons and tests"
msgstr "Masomo na majaribio"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Assignments"
msgstr "Kazi za ziada"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "My grades"
msgstr "Alama zangu"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Teachers"
msgstr "Walimu"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Track each learner's progress"
msgstr "Fuatilia maendeleo ya kila mwanafunzi"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Set and mark assignments"
msgstr "Toa na usahihishe kazi"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Spot who needs help early"
msgstr "Tambua mapema anayehitaji msaada"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Parents"
msgstr "Wazazi"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "View grades and reports"
msgstr "Tazama alama na ripoti"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Check fee balances"
msgstr "Angalia salio la karo"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "See what your child is learning"
msgstr "Ona mtoto wako anachojifunza"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "School admins"
msgstr "Wasimamizi wa shule"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Manage student records"
msgstr "Simamia rekodi za wanafunzi"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Manage fees"
msgstr "Simamia karo"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Add teachers and classes"
msgstr "Ongeza walimu na madarasa"

# Call to action / footer
#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid "Bring EduKenya to your school"
msgstr "Leta EduKenya shuleni kwako"

#: landing/templates/landing/index.html
msgid ""
"Set up your school in a few minutes. Every school gets its own private space."
msgstr ""
"Sajili shule yako kwa dakika chache. Kila shule inapata nafasi yake ya "
"faragha."

#: templates/partials/site_footer.html
msgid "All rights reserved."
msgstr "Haki zote zimehifadhiwa."

#: onboarding/emails.py
msgid "Confirm your email for EduKenya"
msgstr "Thibitisha barua pepe yako kwa EduKenya"

#: onboarding/emails.py
msgid "Someone tried to register a school with your email"
msgstr "Mtu amejaribu kusajili shule kwa barua pepe yako"

#: onboarding/emails.py
msgid "Your school is approved on EduKenya"
msgstr "Shule yako imeidhinishwa kwenye EduKenya"

#: onboarding/emails.py
msgid "Update on your EduKenya school application"
msgstr "Taarifa kuhusu ombi la shule yako kwenye EduKenya"

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "School name"
msgstr "Jina la shule"

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "KNEC school code"
msgstr "Nambari ya shule ya KNEC"

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "The 8 digit code on your KNEC documents."
msgstr "Nambari ya tarakimu 8 iliyo kwenye nyaraka zako za KNEC."

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "County"
msgstr "Kaunti"

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "Choose your county"
msgstr "Chagua kaunti yako"

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "School web address"
msgstr "Anwani ya tovuti ya shule"

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "Lowercase letters, numbers and hyphens. Example: greenhill"
msgstr "Herufi ndogo, nambari na vistari. Mfano: greenhill"

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "Your full name"
msgstr "Jina lako kamili"

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "Your email"
msgstr "Barua pepe yako"

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Nenosiri"

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "At least 10 characters. Avoid common words."
msgstr "Angalau herufi 10. Epuka maneno ya kawaida."

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Thibitisha nenosiri"

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid ""
"A school with this KNEC code is already registered or waiting for approval."
msgstr ""
"Shule yenye nambari hii ya KNEC tayari imesajiliwa au inasubiri kuidhinishwa."

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "This web address is taken. Please choose another."
msgstr "Anwani hii tayari inatumika. Tafadhali chagua nyingine."

#: onboarding/forms.py
msgid "The two passwords do not match."
msgstr "Manenosiri mawili hayafanani."

#: onboarding/views.py
msgid ""
"Someone just registered with these details. Please check the KNEC code and "
"web address."
msgstr ""
"Mtu amesajili kwa taarifa hizi sasa hivi. Tafadhali kagua nambari ya KNEC na "
"anwani ya tovuti."

#: onboarding/views.py
msgid ""
"We could not send the confirmation email right now. Please try again in a few"
" minutes."
msgstr ""
"Hatukuweza kutuma barua pepe ya uthibitisho sasa hivi. Tafadhali jaribu tena "
"baada ya dakika chache."

#: onboarding/views.py
msgid "If that email is waiting for confirmation, we have sent a new link."
msgstr "Ikiwa barua pepe hiyo inasubiri kuthibitishwa, tumetuma kiungo kipya."

#: school/forms.py
msgid "Email"
msgstr "Barua pepe"

#: school/forms.py
msgid "Incorrect email or password."
msgstr "Barua pepe au nenosiri si sahihi."

#: templates/403.html
msgid "Not allowed"
msgstr "Hairuhusiwi"

#: templates/403_csrf.html
msgid "Please try again"
msgstr "Tafadhali jaribu tena"

#: templates/403_csrf.html
msgid ""
"Your session expired or the form was out of date. Go back, refresh the page "
"and try again."
msgstr ""
"Muda wako umeisha au fomu imepitwa na wakati. Rudi nyuma, onyesha upya "
"ukurasa na ujaribu tena."

#: templates/404.html
msgid "Page not found"
msgstr "Ukurasa haukupatikana"

#: templates/404.html
msgid "We could not find what you were looking for."
msgstr "Hatukuweza kupata ulichokuwa ukitafuta."

#: tenancy/validators.py
msgid "The KNEC school code must be exactly 8 digits."
msgstr "Nambari ya shule ya KNEC lazima iwe na tarakimu 8 kamili."

#: tenancy/validators.py
msgid ""
"Use 3 to 30 lowercase letters, numbers or hyphens. It cannot start or end "
"with a hyphen."
msgstr ""
"Tumia herufi ndogo, nambari au vistari, kati ya 3 na 30. Haiwezi kuanza wala "
"kuishia na kistari."

#: tenancy/validators.py
msgid "The web address cannot contain two hyphens in a row."
msgstr "Anwani haiwezi kuwa na vistari viwili mfululizo."

#: tenancy/validators.py
msgid "This web address is reserved. Please choose another."
msgstr "Anwani hii imehifadhiwa. Tafadhali chagua nyingine."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/check_email.html
msgid "Check your email"
msgstr "Angalia barua pepe yako"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/check_email.html
msgid "Step 2 of 3"
msgstr "Hatua 2 kati ya 3"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/check_email.html
msgid ""
"We have sent a confirmation link to the email you entered. Open it and press "
"the button to confirm."
msgstr ""
"Tumetuma kiungo cha uthibitisho kwa barua pepe uliyoandika. Kifungue na "
"ubonyeze kitufe ili kuthibitisha."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/check_email.html
msgid ""
"The link works for 48 hours. Check your spam folder if you cannot see it."
msgstr "Kiungo kinafanya kazi kwa saa 48. Angalia folda ya spam ikiwa hukioni."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/check_email.html
msgid "Did not get it? Send a new link"
msgstr "Hukukipata? Tuma kiungo kipya"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/rate_limited.html
msgid "Please wait a moment"
msgstr "Tafadhali subiri kidogo"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/rate_limited.html
msgid ""
"There have been too many attempts from your connection. Please try again "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Kumekuwa na majaribio mengi kutoka kwa muunganisho wako. Tafadhali jaribu "
"tena baadaye."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/register.html
msgid "Step 1 of 3"
msgstr "Hatua 1 kati ya 3"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/register.html
msgid ""
"Tell us about your school. We will email you a link to confirm, then our team"
" reviews and approves your school."
msgstr ""
"Tueleze kuhusu shule yako. Tutakutumia kiungo cha kuthibitisha, kisha timu "
"yetu itakagua na kuidhinisha shule yako."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/register.html
msgid "Please fix the highlighted fields below."
msgstr "Tafadhali rekebisha sehemu zilizoangaziwa hapa chini."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/register.html
msgid "About the school"
msgstr "Kuhusu shule"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/register.html
msgid "Your school will live at"
msgstr "Shule yako itapatikana kwenye"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/register.html
msgid "About you (the school admin)"
msgstr "Kuhusu wewe (msimamizi wa shule)"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/register.html
msgid "Send confirmation email"
msgstr "Tuma barua pepe ya uthibitisho"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/register.html
msgid "Already registered but lost the email?"
msgstr "Umeshasajili lakini umepoteza barua pepe?"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/register.html
msgid "Get a new link"
msgstr "Pata kiungo kipya"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/resend.html
msgid "Get a new confirmation link"
msgstr "Pata kiungo kipya cha uthibitisho"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/resend.html
msgid "Enter the email you registered with. Any older links will stop working."
msgstr ""
"Andika barua pepe uliyosajili nayo. Viungo vya zamani vitaacha kufanya kazi."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/resend.html
msgid "Send new link"
msgstr "Tuma kiungo kipya"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/verified.html
msgid "Email confirmed"
msgstr "Barua pepe imethibitishwa"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/verified.html
msgid "Step 3 of 3"
msgstr "Hatua 3 kati ya 3"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/verified.html
msgid ""
"Thank you. Our team is now reviewing your school. We will email you as soon "
"as it is approved, usually within one working day."
msgstr ""
"Asante. Timu yetu sasa inakagua shule yako. Tutakutumia barua pepe mara "
"itakapoidhinishwa, kwa kawaida ndani ya siku moja ya kazi."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/verified.html
msgid "Back to home"
msgstr "Rudi mwanzo"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/verify_confirm.html
msgid "Confirm your email"
msgstr "Thibitisha barua pepe yako"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/verify_confirm.html
msgid "Press the button below to confirm this is your email address."
msgstr "Bonyeza kitufe hapa chini kuthibitisha kwamba hii ni barua pepe yako."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/verify_confirm.html
msgid "Yes, confirm my email"
msgstr "Ndiyo, thibitisha barua pepe yangu"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/verify_invalid.html
msgid "This link does not work"
msgstr "Kiungo hiki hakifanyi kazi"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/verify_invalid.html
msgid "It may have expired, been used already, or a newer link was sent."
msgstr "Huenda muda wake umeisha, kimeshatumika, au kiungo kipya kimetumwa."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/verify_invalid.html
msgid "Send me a new link"
msgstr "Nitumie kiungo kipya"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/already_registered.txt
msgid "Hello,"
msgstr "Habari,"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/already_registered.txt
msgid ""
"Someone just tried to register a school on EduKenya using this email address,"
" but it is already linked to a school application."
msgstr ""
"Mtu amejaribu kusajili shule kwenye EduKenya kwa kutumia barua pepe hii, "
"lakini tayari imeunganishwa na ombi la shule."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/already_registered.txt
msgid ""
"If this was you and you still need to confirm your email, you can get a new "
"link here:"
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa ni wewe na bado unahitaji kuthibitisha barua pepe yako, unaweza kupata "
"kiungo kipya hapa:"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/already_registered.txt
msgid "If this was not you, you can ignore this email. Nothing has changed."
msgstr "Ikiwa si wewe, unaweza kupuuza barua pepe hii. Hakuna kilichobadilika."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/approved.txt
#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/rejected.txt
#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/verify.txt
msgid "Hello %(name)s,"
msgstr "Habari %(name)s,"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/approved.txt
msgid "Good news: %(school)s has been approved on EduKenya."
msgstr "Habari njema: %(school)s imeidhinishwa kwenye EduKenya."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/approved.txt
msgid ""
"Your school's own web address is ready. Sign in with the email and password "
"you registered with:"
msgstr ""
"Anwani ya tovuti ya shule yako iko tayari. Ingia kwa barua pepe na nenosiri "
"ulilosajili nalo:"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/approved.txt
msgid ""
"Keep this address safe and share it only with your school's teachers, parents"
" and students."
msgstr ""
"Hifadhi anwani hii vizuri na uishiriki tu na walimu, wazazi na wanafunzi wa "
"shule yako."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/rejected.txt
msgid ""
"Thank you for applying to bring %(school)s to EduKenya. We were not able to "
"approve the application this time."
msgstr ""
"Asante kwa kuomba kuleta %(school)s kwenye EduKenya. Hatukuweza kuidhinisha "
"ombi hili kwa sasa."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/rejected.txt
msgid "Reason given by our team:"
msgstr "Sababu iliyotolewa na timu yetu:"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/rejected.txt
msgid "You are welcome to apply again once this is resolved."
msgstr "Karibu uombe tena baada ya suala hili kutatuliwa."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/verify.txt
msgid ""
"Thank you for registering %(school)s on EduKenya. Please confirm your email "
"address by opening this link:"
msgstr ""
"Asante kwa kusajili %(school)s kwenye EduKenya. Tafadhali thibitisha barua "
"pepe yako kwa kufungua kiungo hiki:"

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/verify.txt
msgid "The link works for %(hours)s hours and can only be used once."
msgstr ""
"Kiungo kinafanya kazi kwa saa %(hours)s na kinaweza kutumika mara moja tu."

#: onboarding/templates/onboarding/email/verify.txt
msgid ""
"If you did not register a school on EduKenya, you can ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa hukusajili shule kwenye EduKenya, unaweza kupuuza barua pepe hii."

#: school/templates/school/base.html
msgid "Sign out"
msgstr "Toka"

#: school/templates/school/base.html
msgid "Powered by EduKenya"
msgstr "Inaendeshwa na EduKenya"

#: school/templates/school/dashboard.html
msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr "Dashibodi"

#: school/templates/school/dashboard.html
msgid "Welcome, %(name)s"
msgstr "Karibu, %(name)s"

#: school/templates/school/dashboard.html
msgid "You are signed in as the admin of %(school)s."
msgstr "Umeingia kama msimamizi wa %(school)s."

#: school/templates/school/dashboard.html
msgid "Tools for adding teachers, parents and students are coming next."
msgstr "Zana za kuongeza walimu, wazazi na wanafunzi zinakuja hivi karibuni."

#: school/templates/school/login.html
msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Ingia"

#: school/templates/school/login.html
msgid "Too many sign in attempts. Please wait 15 minutes and try again."
msgstr ""
"Majaribio mengi ya kuingia. Tafadhali subiri dakika 15 kisha ujaribu tena."
